<li>&lt;a href="1792"&gt;1792&lt;/a&gt; – &lt;a href="Perang%20Koalisi%20Kahiji"&gt;Perang Koalisi Kahiji&lt;/a&gt;: Perancis nyatakeun perang ka Karajaan Sardinia.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1796"&gt;1796&lt;/a&gt; – &lt;a href="Perang%20Koalisi%20Kahiji"&gt;Perang Koalisi Kahiji&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href="Napoleon%20Bonaparte"&gt;Napoléon&lt;/a&gt; hasil ngarebut Milan.</li>
