<li>&lt;a href="1836"&gt;1836&lt;/a&gt; – &lt;a href="Francis%20Baily"&gt;Francis Baily&lt;/a&gt; naliti "geulang Baily” dina &lt;a href="samagaha%20cingcin"&gt;samagaha cingcin&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1850"&gt;1850&lt;/a&gt; – Pangbantéyan Pulo Geutih lumangsung di Lake County, California, di mana sajumlah gedé &lt;a href="Indian%20Pomo"&gt;Indian Pomo&lt;/a&gt; dibantéy ku Kavaleri AS.</li>
