<li>&lt;a href="1977"&gt;1977&lt;/a&gt; – &lt;a href="Luca%20Toni"&gt;Luca Toni&lt;/a&gt;, pamaén bola Italia</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1993"&gt;1993&lt;/a&gt; – &lt;a href="Cut%20Meyriska"&gt;Cut Meyriska&lt;/a&gt;, artis Indonésia</li>
