<h2>Kajadian</h2>
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="1431"&gt;1431&lt;/a&gt; – &lt;a href="Perang%20Saratus%20Taun"&gt;Perang Saratus Taun&lt;/a&gt;: Di Rouen, Perancis, &lt;a href="Joan%20ti%20Arc"&gt;Joan ti Arc&lt;/a&gt;, 19 taun, dibeuleum dina tunggak ku pangadilan nu didominasi ku urang Inggris. &lt;a href="Gar%C3%A9ja%20Katolik%20Roma"&gt;Garéja Katolik Roma&lt;/a&gt; miéling poé ieu minangka Poé Santa Joan ti Arc.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1498"&gt;1498&lt;/a&gt; – &lt;a href="Christopher%20Columbus"&gt;Christopher Columbus&lt;/a&gt; miang ka Amérika pikeun katilu kalina mawa genep kapal.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1510"&gt;1510&lt;/a&gt; – Wanci kakawasaan Kaésar Zhengde, pamingpin pangbarontak &lt;a href="Dinasti%20Ming"&gt;Dinasti Ming&lt;/a&gt;, Zhu Zhifan diéléhkeun ku komandan Qiu Yue, mungkas pangbarontakan Pangéran Anhua.</li>
<li>1510 – Pasukan Portugis dina pingpinan &lt;a href="Afonso%20de%20Albuquerque"&gt;Afonso de Albuquerque&lt;/a&gt; ninggalkeun &lt;a href="Goa"&gt;Goa&lt;/a&gt; sabada pangawasa tiheula, &lt;a href="Yusuf%20Adil%20Syah"&gt;Yusuf Adil Syah&lt;/a&gt;, Raja Muslim &lt;a href="Bijapour"&gt;Bijapour&lt;/a&gt; nalukeun deui kota éta.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1539"&gt;1539&lt;/a&gt; – Di &lt;a href="Florida"&gt;Florida&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hernando%20de%20Soto"&gt;Hernando de Soto&lt;/a&gt; balabuh di &lt;a href="Teluk%20Tampa"&gt;Teluk Tampa&lt;/a&gt; bari mawa 600 soldadu, tujuanna rék nyiar &lt;a href="emas"&gt;emas&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1574"&gt;1574&lt;/a&gt; – &lt;a href="Henry%20III"&gt;Henry III&lt;/a&gt; jadi Raja Perancis.</li>
